WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.400
Open Start here to follow the setup guide.

00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:09.000
Select Play example to see wrist roll
and the gripper move together in 3D.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:13.400
Open Python & 3D to edit a route.
One send_action call can move several joints.

00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:19.400
Select Preview in 3D.
Gold highlights show which motors are moving.

00:00:19.400 --> 00:00:24.000
For a calibrated arm, open Arm setup and choose
Connect by USB. Then read the current pose.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:28.650
Need to calibrate? Open Use the local bridge.
Follow the calibration steps in Start here.
